    {
      "id": "akbul6z",
      "type": "heading",
      "level": 2,
      "content": "CONCLUSION"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "Public Finance is the backbone of a modern economy. Efficient management of revenue, expenditure and deficit",
      "id": "oypj42p"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "content": "helps in economic development, poverty reduction and welfare of people.",
      "id": "ofw48c7"
    }
